# Sample peak vs true peak (5x oversampling by 4-point sinc interpolation). An impulse pair straddling samples gives an inter-sample peak above the sample peak.
init 48000 2
clock 1000000000
source a input
meter_new 0 0
meter_attach 0 a
meter_cb 0 add
output a 48000 2 16 1000000000 impulse 5 1
meter_type 0 1
output a 48000 2 16 1000333333 impulse 5 1
meter_type 0 0
meter_feed 0 a 0 2 16 const 0.5
meter_type 0 1
meter_feed 0 a 0 2 16 sine 11000 0.8 0
meter_type 0 0
meter_feed 0 a 0 2 16 sine 11000 0.8 0
